      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#5C9EFF>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> Mode, TargetResolution,
    ReferenceOrthographicSize / ReferenceFieldOfView, Refresh(), CaptureReferenceFromCamera().\n<color=#5C9EFF>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select 'Main Camera': Reference Size is stored on the
    scaler, so Edit Mode previews never creep the camera size.\n<color=#5C9EFF>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Play, press Phone / Ultrawide and switch modes: the readout
    says which part of the design frame is cropped.\n<color=#5C9EFF>\xBB</color> 
    Reference slider -> CameraAspectRatioScaler.ReferenceOrthographicSize (NoCode)\n<color=#5C9EFF>\xBB</color> 
    Mode / Design / Output -> CameraAspectRatioDemoController (C#)"
